00:07:07.220 --> 00:07:24.060
Now, one of the great differences between Jewish society and pagan society is what I call the difference between a vertical society and a horizontal society.

00:07:24.060 --> 00:07:31.060
In Judaism, the society, our society is horizontal.

00:07:31.060 --> 00:07:38.060
In this parasha we are going to study, we are going to read it this Shabbat, we make a covenant with God.

00:07:38.060 --> 00:07:46.060
