00:07:46.060 --> 00:07:51.060
So therefore, there is a total absolute horizontality.

00:07:51.060 --> 00:08:05.220
Nobody is higher than the other. Yes, the law says that in this case somebody has more or less authority, but the one who gives authority is not a person but the law.

00:08:05.220 --> 00:08:26.640
In other words, we are all equal in front of the law. In a pagan society, always we have a vertical hierarchy. One person is above the other. You listen to your boss above and you give orders to the one below.

00:08:26.640 --> 00:08:50.740
So there is a vertical relationship. Even in our America, yes, ultimately we are guided by the Constitution. But the Constitution is what nine persons in black robes that were never voted say that the Constitution is what the Constitution is.

00:08:50.740 --> 00:09:10.480
